OL,3,GEast Midlands
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FGenerally dry with sunny
OL,6,Fintervals, but there is a risk of
OL,7,Fisolated showers during the morning,
OL,8,Fthese dying out into the afternoon.
OL,9,FWinds falling light, and feeling warm
OL,10,Fin the sunshine.
OL,11,
OL,12,CTonight:FA dry evening with sunny
OL,13,Fspells, then clear spells overnight.
OL,14,FCloud thickening later in the night,
OL,15,Fwith some light rain possible in the
OL,16,Fnorth by dawn. Wind strengthening
OL,17,Flater.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
