OL,3,GEast Midlands
OL,4,
OL,5,CSaturday:FBecoming wet and windy in
OL,6,Fthe north during the morning, this
OL,7,Flikely spreading to southern parts
OL,8,Fduring the afternoon and potentially
OL,9,Fcontinuing through the evening. Rain
OL,10,Fcould be occasionally heavy.
OL,11,
OL,12,COutlook for Sunday to Tuesday:FRather
OL,13,Funsettled during this period, with a
OL,14,Fmixture of rain or showers and drier
OL,15,Fintervals with sunny spells.
OL,16,FOccasionally breezy. Warm temperatures
OL,17,Fat first, trending near normal on
OL,18,FTuesday.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
